<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Willamette raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Willamette raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said analyst Steven Dietrich upgraded Willamette Industries Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Dietrich raised his earnings estimates to $3.87 per share from $3.84 for 1996, and to $4.70 from $4.15 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- He cited higher than previously forecast operating margins in the paper and lumber businesses.</p>
<p>-- Willamette fell 1/4 to 67-3/4 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
